@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Service - haveit design";
}
<style>
    .legal-wrap {
        max-width: 880px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 70px 4% 80px
    }

    .legal-badge {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        background: #151515;
        border: 1px solid #222;
        border-radius: 100px;
        padding: 7px 14px;
        color: #777;
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: .08em;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 22px
    }

        .legal-badge b {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
            background: #00AEEF;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #00AEEF
        }

    .legal-wrap h1 {
        font-size: clamp(36px,6vw,56px);
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: -.04em;
        line-height: .9;
        margin-bottom: 14px
    }

        .legal-wrap h1 span {
            color: #FF9A3C
        }

    .legal-meta {
        color: #4A4A4A;
        font-size: 13px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        display: flex;
        gap: 14px;
        flex-wrap: wrap
    }

    .legal-card {
        background: #101010;
        border: 1px solid #181818;
        border-radius: 22px;
        padding: 28px 26px;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
        opacity: 1 !important;
        transform: none !important
    }

        .legal-card h2 {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -.02em;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px
        }

            .legal-card h2 i {
                width: 28px;
                height: 28px;
                border-radius: 9px;
                background: #1A1A1A;
                border: 1px solid #222;
                display: grid;
                place-items: center;
                font-style: normal;
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #FF9A3C
            }

        .legal-card p, .legal-card li {
            color: #9A9A9A;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.75
        }

        .legal-card ul {
            padding-left: 18px;
            display: grid;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-top: 10px
        }

    .legal-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 18px
    }

    @@media(max-width:700px) {
        .legal-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr
        }
    }
</style>

<section class="legal-wrap">
    <div class="legal-badge"><b></b> LEGAL • UPDATED FEB 2026</div>
    <h1>Terms of <span>Service</span></h1>
    <div class="legal-meta"><span>haveit design — Stand Out To Impress</span><span>•</span><span>Kenyan Law Applies</span></div>

    <div class="legal-card"><h2><i>01</i> Scope</h2><p>By booking a Growth Audit, ordering a logo ($12-$100), print ($9+), or website (From $210 Static / $450 E-commerce / $1000 Dynamic), you agree to these terms.</p></div>

    <div class="legal-grid">
        <div class="legal-card">
            <h2><i>02</i> Delivery & Revisions</h2><ul>
            <li>Audit: 24hrs • Logo: 2-3 days • Website: 7-14 days • Ads: 48hrs</li>
            <li>Logo / Print: 2 complimentary designs, x3 free revisions</li>
            <li>Extra revisions at KES 500 each</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-card">
        <h2><i>03</i> Payments</h2><ul>
        <li>Live Rate: $1 = KES auto-updating. Price locked at WhatsApp confirmation.</li>
        <li>50% upfront for websites, 100% for logos & print</li>
        <li>M-Pesa, Bank, PayPal. You own 100% after payment.</li>
    </ul>
</div>
</div>

<div class="legal-card"><h2><i>04</i> What We Don't Do</h2><p>We don't promise specific ROAS. We show 312% avg & 4.9/5 from 100+ reviews as past performance. No refunds after source files sent, but we fix until it converts.</p></div>
<div class="legal-card">
    <h2><i>05</i> Client Responsibilities</h2><ul>
    <li>Provide content, brand assets, timely feedback (48hr window)</li>
    <li>Domain & hosting not included in $210/$450/$1000 website</li>
    <li>No illegal content. You warrant you own your brief.</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="legal-card"><h2><i>06</i> Intellectual Property</h2><p>After full payment, full ownership transfers to you: AI, EPS, PNG, fonts, colors, logins. We reserve right to show work in portfolio unless you request NDA before order.</p></div>
<div class="legal-card"><h2><i>07</i> Limitation & Law</h2><p>Liability capped at amount paid. Kenyan courts, Nanyuki/Meru jurisdiction. No lock-in contracts.</p></div>

<div style="margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
    <a href="/" class="btn-nav" style="display:inline-flex">← Back to Home</a>
    <a href="/Home/Privacy" style="color:#777;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 0">View Privacy →</a>
</div>
</section>